sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 사용자
    participant Controller as CouponController
    participant Service as CouponService
    participant EventPublisher as ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant Listener as CouponEventListener
    participant OutboxRepo as CouponOutboxRepository
    participant KafkaPublisher as CouponEventPublisher
    participant Repository as CouponRepository
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant Scheduler as CouponScheduler
    participant Processor as CouponIssueProcessor
    participant Consumer as CouponEventConsumer

    Note over User, Consumer: 1. 쿠폰 발급 요청 단계
    User->>Controller: POST /coupons/{id}/issue-requests
    Controller->>Service: enqueue(CouponCommand.Issue)
    Service->>Repository: findById(couponId) - 쿠폰 존재 확인
    Repository-->>Service: Coupon
    Service->>EventPublisher: publishEvent(CouponEvent.Issue)

    Note over EventPublisher, OutboxRepo: 2. 이벤트 처리 단계 (트랜잭션 내)
    EventPublisher->>Listener: saveToOutbox(event) - BEFORE_COMMIT
    Listener->>OutboxRepo: save(event) - 아웃박스에 저장

    Note over EventPublisher, KafkaPublisher: 3. 메시지 발행 단계 (트랜잭션 커밋 후)
    EventPublisher->>Listener: handleOrderCompletedEvent(event) - AFTER_COMMIT
    Listener->>KafkaPublisher: publish("coupon-issue", event)
    KafkaPublisher->>KafkaPublisher: 카프카로 메시지 전송

    Service-->>Controller: true
    Controller-->>User: 요청 성공 응답

    Note over Scheduler, Cache: 4. 스케줄러를 통한 대기열 처리 (매 1분)
    Scheduler->>Repository: findIssuableCoupons(now-1분)
    Repository-->>Scheduler: List<Coupon>

    loop 각 쿠폰마다
        Scheduler->>Processor: processCouponIssuance(coupon)
        Processor->>Cache: getRequestsByTimestamp(couponId, issuableCount)
        Cache-->>Processor: 대기열에서 선착순 사용자 목록

        loop 각 사용자마다
            Processor->>Repository: findById(userId)
            Repository-->>Processor: User
            Processor->>Processor: coupon.issue(user) - 쿠폰 발급 로직
        end

        Processor->>Cache: addIssuedCoupon(성공한 사용자들)
        Processor->>Cache: removeRequests(처리된 요청들)
        Processor->>Cache: addFailures(실패한 사용자들)
    end

    Note over Consumer, Repository: 5. 카프카 컨슈머를 통한 실제 발급 처리
    Consumer->>OutboxRepo: findUnpublishedEvents("Issue")
    OutboxRepo-->>Consumer: 미처리 아웃박스 이벤트들

    Consumer->>Consumer: 수신된 메시지들을 배치 처리

    loop 각 메시지마다
        Consumer->>Consumer: findMatchingOutbox(message)
        Consumer->>Repository: findById(couponId)
        Consumer->>Repository: findById(userId)
        Consumer->>Repository: isIssuedMember(중복 확인)
        Consumer->>Consumer: coupon.issue(user) - 실제 쿠폰 발급
        Consumer->>Consumer: outbox.published() - 아웃박스 상태 변경
    end

    Consumer->>Repository: saveAllCouponissues(발급된 쿠폰들)
    Consumer->>Cache: addIssuedCoupon(발급 이력 캐시 저장)
    Consumer->>OutboxRepo: saveAll(업데이트된 아웃박스들)